### 회원가입
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "12345678",
  "nickname": "테스트"
}

### 로그인
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "12345678"
}

### 로그인 실패 테스트 (비밀번호 틀림)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "wrongpassword"
}

### 헬스체크
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/health